### ============================================================
### KAISE CHALAYEIN (Cursor / VS Code)
### 1) Extension: "REST Client" by Huachao Mao
### 2) Copy .vscode/settings.example.json → .vscode/settings.json
###    aur apne real credentials bharo (settings.json gitignore hai)
### 3) Status bar se REST Client environment "local" select karo
### 4) POST line KE UPAR "Send Request" pe click karo
###
### CORS: VENDORYX_CORS_ORIGIN comma-separated, e.g.
###   https://vendoryx-frontend.pages.dev,http://localhost:4200
### OPTIONS preflight → 204 (no token). Never uses Allow-Origin: *
### ============================================================

@shopToken = {{shopLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 1) Login shop user
# @name shopLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{shopUser}}",
  "password": "{{shopPassword}}"
}

### 2) Login admin (DEVELOPER)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{adminUser}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### 3) My shops (SHOP_USER — token shopIds)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/my-shops
Authorization: Bearer {{shopToken}}

### 4) Catalog categories (any logged-in user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{shopToken}}

### 5) Catalog products list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/products?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{shopToken}}

### 6) Admin products list (with stock)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products?page=1&size=20&includeInactive=false
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7) Place order (SHOP_USER) — update shopId/productId as needed
# @name placeOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{shopToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shopId": 1,
  "notes": "Test order from api-tests.http",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 8) Shop user — my orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{shopToken}}

### 9) Admin — orders list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10) Admin — order detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders?id={{placeOrder.response.body.$.data.orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 11) Admin — change status PENDING -> APPROVED
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/status?id={{placeOrder.response.body.$.data.orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newStatus": "APPROVED",
  "comments": "Stock checked and approved"
}

### 12) Admin — update product stock
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products/stock?productId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stockQuantity": 100,
  "lowStockThreshold": 10
}

### 13) Admin — route sheet (open orders for a visit day)
### dayId required (visit_days.day_id). cityId/status/from/to optional.
### Default status = PENDING,APPROVED,PROCESSING,PACKED,OUT_FOR_DELIVERY
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/route-sheet?dayId=1&cityId=1&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 14) Admin — route sheet filtered by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/route-sheet?dayId=1&status=PENDING,APPROVED
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
